OL,3,GNEWSACouncil rejects planning bid by
OL,4,Ahomeless shelter over crime fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have voted to reject a
OL,7,Fplanning application brought by a
OL,8,Fcontroversial homeless shelter in
OL,9,FGlasgow.
OL,11,FThe charity Homeless Project Scotland
OL,12,F(HPS) has provided an overnight space
OL,13,Fand soup kitchen at the Glassford
OL,14,FStreet premises without planning
OL,15,Fpermission since November 2023.
OL,17,FGlasgow City Council's planning
OL,18,Fcommittee said police reports of crime
OL,19,Fand anti-social behaviour at the site,
OL,20,Fas well as concerns over public safety,
OL,21,Fwere behind its decision.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
