OL,3,GNEWSACouncil rejects planning bid by
OL,4,Ahomeless shelter over crime fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity - which says the shelter
OL,7,Fsupports around 30 people a night - is
OL,8,Fconsidering whether to appeal.
